<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Bharat Alert: weather and disaster guide</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#fff7ee;--fg:#1b2240;--mute:#5d6485;--card:#fff;--line:#ecdfcd;--pri:#e8590c;--grn:#12805c;--navy:#1b2a5e;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#0e1426;--fg:#eef0fa;--mute:#a4abc8;--card:#18203a;--line:#2b3556;--pri:#ff8a3d;color-scheme:dark}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#0e1426;--fg:#eef0fa;--mute:#a4abc8;--card:#18203a;--line:#2b3556;--pri:#ff8a3d;color-scheme:dark}
html{scroll-padding-top:80px;height:100%}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:16px/1.55 "Trebuchet MS",Verdana,system-ui,sans-serif}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;margin:0}
.wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px}
.bar{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:10;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff9933,#f26b1d 40%,#12805c);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 2px 10px #0004}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto;height:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);background:#ff9933;z-index:11}
.top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 0 4px;gap:10px}
.logo{font:700 22px Georgia,serif;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
.logo svg{width:28px;height:28px}
#theme{border:2px solid #fff;background:#0003;color:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;cursor:pointer;font:600 13px inherit}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;padding:4px 0 10px;scrollbar-width:none}
.tabs button{flex:none;border:0;background:#ffffff26;color:#fff;font:700 14px "Trebuchet MS",sans-serif;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:20px;cursor:pointer}
.tabs button[aria-selected=true]{background:#fff;color:#b8430a}
button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--pri);outline-offset:2px}
.pn{display:none;padding:22px 0 50px}.pn.on{display:block}
.hero{position:relative;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;min-height:300px;background:#1b2a5e}
.hero svg.bg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
.hero .in{position:relative;padding:34px 24px 26px;max-width:620px;text-shadow:0 2px 8px #0008}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(32px,7vw,56px);line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:12px}
.hero p{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 16px}
.btn{display:inline-block;border:0;border-radius:24px;padding:10px 18px;background:#fff;color:#b8430a;font:700 15px "Trebuchet MS",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;margin:0 8px 8px 0;text-decoration:none;text-shadow:none}
.btn.alt{background:#0005;color:#fff;border:2px solid #fff}
.note{background:var(--card);border-left:6px solid var(--pri);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;margin:18px 0}
h2{font-size:28px;margin:26px 0 4px}.lead{color:var(--mute);margin:0 0 14px}
.grid{display:grid;gap:14px}
@media(min-width:700px){.g2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
.cg{display:grid;gap:14px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr))}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #0000000d}
.tiles{display:grid;gap:10px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(120px,1fr))}
.tile{border:0;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 8px;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;font:700 14px "Trebuchet MS",sans-serif;text-align:center}
.tile svg{width:44px;height:44px;display:block;margin:0 auto 6px}
svg.ic{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
select,input[type=search],textarea{font:16px inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--card);color:var(--fg);width:100%}
.row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:0 0 14px}
.row select,.row input{flex:1 1 180px;width:auto}
.chip{border:2px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--fg);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 12px;font:600 13px "Trebuchet MS",sans-serif;cursor:pointer}
.chip.on{background:var(--navy);border-color:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.cc{all:unset;cursor:pointer;display:block;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #0000000d;transition:transform .15s}
.cc:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}.cc:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--pri)}
.pic{height:110px}.pic svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
.cb{padding:10px 14px 14px}.cb h3{font-size:20px}.cb p{margin:2px 0 6px;font-size:14px;color:var(--mute)}
.rg{display:inline-block;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:1px 9px;font:700 11px sans-serif}
.mini{display:flex;gap:6px;min-height:26px}.mini svg{width:26px;height:26px;padding:3px;border-radius:8px;color:#fff}
.banner{position:relative;height:190px;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;margin:10px 0 16px}
.banner svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
.banner div{position:absolute;left:18px;bottom:12px;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 2px 8px #000a}
.banner h2{margin:0;font-size:36px}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:14px 0}
.stat{border-radius:14px;padding:12px;color:#fff}
.stat b{display:block;font:700 26px Georgia,serif}.stat span{font-size:13px;opacity:.95}
.chart{width:100%;height:auto;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px}
.chart text{fill:var(--mute);font:10px sans-serif}.chart .gr{stroke:var(--line)}
.chart .t{fill:none;stroke-width:2.5;stroke-dasharray:5 3}
.key{font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);margin:6px 0}
.lg{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px;margin:6px 0}.lg i{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:-1px}
.risk{display:grid;grid-template-columns:30px 100px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.risk svg{width:30px;height:30px;padding:4px;border-radius:9px;color:#fff}
.pips{display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;font:700 13px sans-serif}
.pip{width:20px;height:10px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--line)}.pips span{margin-left:6px}
.gc h4{font:700 12px sans-serif;letter-spacing:.8px;margin:12px 0 2px}
.gc ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:15px}
.gh{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:12px}
.gh svg{width:60px;height:60px;flex:none}.gh p{margin:2px 0 0}
.bef{border-top:5px solid #2f9e44}.dur{border-top:5px solid #f08c00}.aft{border-top:5px solid #1c7ed6}
.rad{display:grid;gap:10px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(210px,1fr))}
.rad button{all:unset;cursor:pointer;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 12px;display:block}
.tg{display:inline-block;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:1px 8px;font:700 12px sans-serif;margin:3px 4px 0 0}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;font-size:15px}
td,th{padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left}th{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;font-family:Georgia,serif}
.bars{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 14px}
.br{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr 80px;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;margin:5px 0}
.br div{height:16px;border-radius:8px}
.kit{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.kit li{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:8px}
.kit label{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:10px 12px;cursor:pointer}.kit input{width:22px;height:22px;accent-color:var(--grn);flex:none}
.done span{text-decoration:line-through;color:var(--mute)}
.prog{height:16px;background:var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin:8px 0}.prog div{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff9933,#12805c);transition:width .3s}
.nums{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(130px,1fr));gap:12px}
.nums div{border-radius:16px;padding:14px;text-align:center;color:#fff;font-size:14px}.nums b{display:block;font:700 34px Georgia,serif}
.link{display:inline-block;margin:6px 8px 0 0;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}
footer{padding:10px 0 50px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mute)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bar"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="top"><div class="logo"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 48 48" style="stroke:#fff" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 4L6 12v12c0 10 8 17 18 20c10-3 18-10 18-20V12z"/><path d="M24 14v12M24 32v2"/></svg>Bharat Alert</div><button id="theme" type="button" aria-label="Switch between light and dark">Light / dark</button></div>
 <div class="tabs" role="tablist" id="tabs"></div>
</div></div>
<main class="wrap">
<section class="pn" id="p-home">
 <div class="hero"><svg class="bg" viewBox="0 0 800 320" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="hg" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#1b2a5e"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#e8590c"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#ffc46b"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="800" height="320" fill="url(#hg)"/><circle cx="640" cy="190" r="46" fill="#fff3c4"/><path d="M0 250L120 160L200 220L320 130L450 230L560 170L700 240L800 190V320H0z" fill="#2c3a78" opacity=".85"/><path d="M0 285Q100 255 200 280T400 275T600 285T800 270V320H0z" fill="#12805c"/><path d="M0 305Q100 290 200 305T400 300T600 305T800 298V320H0z" fill="#0b5c42"/></svg>
 <div class="in"><h1>Know your weather.<br>Know your risks.<br>Be ready.</h1><p>Explore 18 places across India: seasonal weather, the disasters each is prone to, and exactly what to do before, during and after.</p><button class="btn" data-go="cities">Explore places</button><button class="btn alt" data-go="ready">Build your kit</button></div></div>
 <div class="note"><b>Please read.</b> Charts show long-term typical values, rounded, and risk levels are simple learning guides. This app shows no live weather or real warnings. For today’s alerts use the official sources on the Help tab.</div>
 <h2>Season radar</h2><p class="lead">Pick a month to see which places usually face trouble then.</p>
 <div class="row"><select id="mon" aria-label="Month"></select></div><div class="rad" id="rad"></div>
 <h2>Seven hazards</h2><p class="lead">Tap one to open its safety guide.</p><div class="tiles" id="tiles"></div>
</section>

<section class="pn" id="p-cities">
 <h2 style="margin-top:0">Weather and risks by place</h2><p class="lead">Search, filter by region or hazard, then open a place.</p>
 <div id="cfilters"><div class="row"><input type="search" id="q" placeholder="Search a place…" aria-label="Search places"><select id="hf" aria-label="Filter by hazard"></select></div><div class="row" id="rchips"></div></div>
 <div id="cout"></div>
</section>

<section class="pn" id="p-compare">
 <h2 style="margin-top:0">Compare places</h2><p class="lead">Put two places side by side.</p>
 <div class="row"><select id="ca" aria-label="First place"></select><select id="cb" aria-label="Second place"></select></div>
 <div id="cmp"></div>
 <h2>Rank every place</h2><div class="row"><select id="met" aria-label="Metric"><option value="rain">Yearly rainfall</option><option value="hot">Warmest month temperature</option><option value="risk">Overall risk score</option></select></div><div class="bars" id="rank"></div>
</section>

<section class="pn" id="p-guide">
 <h2 style="margin-top:0">Disaster guide</h2><p class="lead">Choose a hazard for before, during and after steps.</p>
 <div class="row" id="gtabs"></div><div id="gout"></div>
</section>

<section class="pn" id="p-ready">
 <h2 style="margin-top:0">Emergency kit checklist</h2><p class="lead">Tick items as you pack them. Your ticks stay on this device.</p>
 <div class="prog"><div id="bar"></div></div><p class="key" id="prog"></p>
 <ul class="kit" id="kitList"></ul><button class="chip" id="reset" type="button">Reset checklist</button>
 <h2>Family plan</h2><p class="lead">Fill this in and it is saved on this device.</p>
 <div class="grid g3">
  <div class="card"><h3>Meeting point</h3><p class="key">One spot near home, one outside your area.</p><textarea id="f1" rows="3"></textarea></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>Contact person</h3><p class="key">A relative in another city everyone can call.</p><textarea id="f2" rows="3"></textarea></div>
  <div class="card"><h3>Practice</h3><p class="key">When will you walk the exit route, with children and elders?</p><textarea id="f3" rows="3"></textarea></div>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="pn" id="p-help">
 <h2 style="margin-top:0">Help and sources</h2><p class="lead">Call these numbers in an emergency.</p>
 <div class="nums"><div style="background:#d6336c"><b>112</b>All emergencies</div><div style="background:#12805c"><b>108</b>Ambulance</div><div style="background:#e8590c"><b>101</b>Fire</div><div style="background:#1c7ed6"><b>100</b>Police</div></div>
 <h3 style="margin-top:22px">Official sources for live information</h3>
 <a class="link" href="https://mausam.imd.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Weather and cyclones (IMD)</a><a class="link" href="https://cwc.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Floods (CWC)</a><a class="link" href="https://sachet.ndma.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Alerts (NDMA SACHET)</a><a class="link" href="https://incois.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ocean and tsunami (INCOIS)</a><a class="link" href="https://seismo.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Earthquakes (NCS)</a>
</section>
<footer>Bharat Alert is a proposed educational project with no government affiliation. It does not replace official warnings or emergency services. Earthquakes cannot be predicted.</footer>
</main>
